- `"endpoint"`: Required. The information about the instance endpoint.', example='{"id":"test","enabled":"true","mode":"Collecting","users":{"applies_to":[]},"endpoint":"[{"EndpointName":"pe-************","EndpointType":"Cluster","DBEndpointDescription":"Cluster Address"},{"EndpointName":"pe-************","EndpointType":"Custom","DBEndpointDescription":"pc-************"},{"EndpointName":"pe-************","EndpointType":"Custom","DBEndpointDescription":"pc-************K"}]","type":"WhiteList"}', position='Query'),
