  ruleConfig: string(name='RuleConfig', description='The JSON string of the configuration parameters and their values for the SQL throttling rule to be modified. All parameter values are of the string type. Example: `{"id":"test","enabled":"true","match_mode":"0","template":"dXBkYXRlIHQgc2V0IGEgPSAxIHdoZXJlIGlkID0gMQ==","user":"","database":"","waiting":1024,"endpoint":"[{"EndpointName":"pe-***********","EndpointType":"Cluster","DBEndpointDescription":"Cluster Address"}]","throttle_mode":0,"concurrency":1}`. Parameters:
