  - The name cannot exceed 30 characters in length.
  - The name must consist of uppercase and lowercase letters and digits.

This parameter is required.', example='{"id":"test","enabled":"true","match_mode":"0","template":"dXBkYXRlIHQgc2V0IGEgPSAxIHdoZXJlIGlkID0gMQ==","user":"","database":"","waiting":1024,"endpoint":"[{"EndpointName":"pe-***********","EndpointType":"Cluster","DBEndpointDescription":"Cluster Address"}]","throttle_mode":0,"concurrency":1}', position='Query'),
