> * The latest time must be at least 30 minutes later than the start time.
> * If `PlannedStartTime` is specified but this parameter is not, the latest start time defaults to 30 minutes after the start time. For example, if `PlannedStartTime` is set to `2021-01-14T09:00:00Z` and this parameter is left empty, the task will start no later than `2021-01-14T09:30:00Z`.', example='2021-01-14T09:30:00Z', position='Query'),
  plannedStartTime?: string(name='PlannedStartTime', description='The earliest time to start the scheduled task. The time must be in the `YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ssZ` format and in UTC.
